flowchart TD
  ADMIN[Company administrator / CCO] --> UI[Next.js SalesOS Console]
  SALES[Sales team] --> UI
  UI --> API[NestJS API / Auth / PolicyService]
  DISC[Authorized research sources] --> ING[Lead source adapters]
  MAIL[Authorized business email] <--> MAILAD[Mailbox adapter]
  CAL[Calendar provider] <--> CALAD[Calendar adapter]
  MEET[Consented meeting transcript / permitted provider artifact] --> MI[Meeting intake + artifact consent gate]
  ING --> QUEUE[BullMQ + Redis]
  MAILAD <--> QUEUE
  CALAD <--> QUEUE
  MI --> QUEUE
  API <--> DB[(PostgreSQL tenant tables + RLS)]
  API --> QUEUE
  QUEUE --> SUP[Continuous Sales Supervisor]
  SUP --> PLAN[LLM action planning + approved tenant knowledge]
  PLAN --> POLICY{Deterministic policy gate}
  POLICY -->|Blocked / approval needed| UI
  POLICY -->|Authorized| ACT[Typed action executor]
  ACT --> MAILAD
  ACT --> CALAD
  ACT --> TASK[CRM tasks, meetings, briefs, notes]
  TASK --> DB
  MI --> NOTES[Transcript processing + source-anchored meeting notes]
  NOTES --> TASK
  API --> STOP[Per-tenant immediate pause / audit]
  STOP --> POLICY
